+# Mini Template
+
+Dependency-free TypeScript template renderer for Bun.
+
+```ts
+import { render } from './src/engine';
+render('Hello, {{name}}!', { name: 'Ada' });
+```
+
+Values use dotted paths and are HTML-escaped by default; triple braces are raw. The supported blocks are `#if`, `#each` (with `{{this}}` and `{{@index}}`), `{{else}}`, and comments `{{! ... }}`. Missing values become empty strings, while objects and functions in interpolations are rejected.
+
+CLI: `bun run src/cli.ts TEMPLATE_FILE DATA.json`.
