+Dependency-free TypeScript template renderer for Bun.
+
+```ts
+import { render } from './src/engine';
+render('Hello, {{name}}!', { name: '<world>' });
+```
+
+`{{path}}` is HTML-escaped, while `{{{path}}}` is raw. Use `#if`, `#each`,
+`else`, `this`, and `@index`; comments use `{{! ... }}`. Missing values are
+empty, and objects/functions cannot be rendered as scalar values.
+
+```sh
+bun run src/cli.ts TEMPLATE_FILE DATA.json
+bun test
+```
